  "reasoning": "The defendant abandoned his newborn daughter by leaving her in a ditch. Under Chinese criminal law, abandoning a minor (especially a newborn) constitutes the crime of abandonment (遗弃罪). No other offenses such as homicide are indicated because the child was not confirmed dead, only taken by others. Therefore the appropriate charge is abandonment.",
